jsilib
======

A Python >= 3.6 client/server implementation for the JSONRPC/JSI protocols
designed, maintained and used by FDSW. It is built on top of **asyncio**
toolkit from Python's standard library with a tiny help of external libraries
(which are **aiofiles** and **websockets**).

